<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Thermo BioAnalysis upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Thermo BioAnalysis upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Thermo BioAnalysis Corp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 or 4.5 percent to 14-1/4 in early Tuesday trading on the American Stock Exchange .</p>
<p>-- In a report, Lehman analyst Angus Macdonald raised his EPS forecast to $0.70 from $0.66 in 1997 and to $0.90 from $0.85 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Sees healthy 1997 internal growth, augmented by the Life Sciences acquisition. Expects bottom line growth to exceed top line due to improved operating efficiencies. and said the stock seems undervalued related to its peers.</p>
</text>
